callee 1 submit runtime take,read scalar -
callee 2 group_end runtime take scalar -
block b0 preds -
inst %0 group_open Call reads - consumes - state owned parents - from - callee 0
inst %1 list_new Fresh reads - consumes - state owned parents -
inst %2 box_make Construct reads %1,%0 consumes - state owned parents - lent %0
inst %3 record_make Construct reads - consumes %2 state owned parents -
inst %4 submit Call reads %0 consumes %3 state scalar parents - from - callee 1
term jump b1
block b1 preds b0
phi %5 owned parents - edges b0:%0
inst - group_end Call reads - consumes %5 state none parents - from - callee 2
inst - drop Drop reads - consumes %1 state none parents -
term ret -
end
function ok_trap_group result scalar from - unchecked -
callee 0 group_open runtime - scalar -
callee 1 submit runtime take,read scalar -
callee 2 call runtime read scalar -
inst %9 iconst Constant reads - consumes - state scalar parents -
block b0 preds -
inst %0 group_open Call reads - consumes - state owned parents - from - callee 0
inst %1 list_new Fresh reads - consumes - state owned parents -
inst %2 box_make Construct reads %1,%0 consumes - state owned parents - lent %0
inst %3 record_make Construct reads - consumes %2 state owned parents -
inst %4 submit Call reads %0 consumes %3 state scalar parents - from - callee 1
term branch %9 b1 b2
block b1 preds b0
term jump b3
block b2 preds b0
term jump b3
block b3 preds b1,b2
inst - call Call reads %9 consumes - state none parents - from - callee 2
term unreachable
end
